<div style="text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: {{theme.primaryDark}}; margin: 0 0 8px;">
        Your Invitation Letter Is Ready
    </h2>
    <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #6b7280; margin: 0 0 24px;">
        Hi {{name}}, great news. Your Letter of Acceptance is ready to download.
    </p>

    {{#if program}}
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 24px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em;">
        {{program}}
    </p>
    {{/if}}

    <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 24px;">
        Log in to your participant portal to download your Invitation Letter (Letter of Acceptance). For security, we don&rsquo;t attach documents directly to email. Open the Documents section of your dashboard to grab it any time.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.6; text-align: left; margin: 0 0 24px;">
        Don&rsquo;t see it there yet? Double-check that your application has been submitted. That&rsquo;s the most common reason a letter isn&rsquo;t showing up.
    </p>

    <a href="{{documentsUrl}}" class="cta-button">
        Download Your Invitation Letter
    </a>

    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.6; margin: 32px 0 0;">
        Congratulations, and we look forward to welcoming you to the program.
    </p>
</div>
